{%- comment -%}
  Product card — the name of the value the card currently stands on.

  "White Gold". One element, and its whole job is to follow the pick: it is
  `[data-card-meta]`, which is what `theme.js` writes into when a swatch or a
  pill is chosen.

  **It is a block of its own so the caption can be composed rather than
  assembled here.** It used to be part of `product-card-variants`, which also
  appended a carat weight from `custom.total_carat_weight` and joined the two
  with " · ". That put one shop's catalogue into the theme: a store selling
  anything else got a hardcoded lookup that resolves to nothing, and no way to
  put its own fact there instead. Now the row is a `group` holding this, a
  `product-card-text` carrying the separator, and another bound to whatever
  metafield the shop actually keeps.

  **It does not choose which option it names.** The card's option is derived
  identically by the price, the button and the control through
  `snippets/card-option.liquid` — a block cannot share a setting with its
  siblings, so a picker here would name one option while the price answered for
  another.

  Where the piece has no such option the element still renders and holds its
  row, which is `.card__meta`'s `min-height: 1.5em` doing what it has always
  done: keep a row of cards level when one piece has a caption and its
  neighbour does not. It is marked `data-card-meta-fixed` there, so the script
  leaves alone an element nothing can change.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product = block.settings.product | default: closest.product

  capture card_option_raw
    render 'card-option', product: product
  endcapture
  assign card_option = card_option_raw | strip | split: '||'
  assign opt_index = card_option[0] | plus: 0
  assign selected_value = ''
  if card_option.size > 2
    assign selected_value = card_option[1]
  endif
-%}

<span
  class="card__meta"
  data-card-meta
  {% if opt_index < 0 %}data-card-meta-fixed{% endif %}
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>{{ selected_value }}</span>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.product_card_option_name.name",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.all.content_source_header"
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "product",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.product_source.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.product_source.info"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:blocks.product_card_option_name.name",
      "settings": {
        "product": "{{ closest.product }}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
